From e18726ce9d6affbc478a073b293a49a4ea134b7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joachim Wiberg <troglobit@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:25:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 144/156] net: sparx5: add the TAS list, gate control list and
 gate state registers
Organization: Wires

The time-aware shaper of SparX-5 and LAN969x is driven through the
TAS_LIST_CFG, TAS_GCL_CFG and HSCH_TAS_STATE register groups.  The
driver only knows TAS_CONFIG and TAS_PROFILE_CFG, enough to set the
link speed of a port.

Add the remaining TAS registers, with the field widths that differ
between the two chips, from the vendor BSP kernel[1].

[1] https://github.com/microchip-ung/linux/tree/bsp-6.18-2026

Signed-off-by: Joachim Wiberg <troglobit@gmail.com>
